This collector is designed to:
• fetch open interest from OKX and Hyperliquid
• normalize venue responses into asset-level OI rows
• persist rolling OI history
• emit structured signals for ToknClaw flow strategies
• detect cross-venue OI divergence
• remain additive and OpenClaw agent ready

Primary Config
--------------
/opt/toknclaw/config/open_interest_collector.json

Primary Outputs
---------------
• perp_open_interest
• perp_open_interest_high
• perp_open_interest_divergence
• perp_open_interest_summary

Primary Persistence
-------------------
/opt/toknclaw/data/flow/open_interest_history.json
